<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Columbia/HCA said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Columbia/HCA said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs downgraded Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp to market perform from outperform, a source at Goldman said.  </p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 37-1/2 on Thursday and were delayed at the open on the New York Stock Exchange for an imbalance.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
